  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The Shiba Inu dog is mapped as the entity expressing the hateful sentiment",
  "description": "The text 'i do not like black people' is superimposed on the image of the Shiba Inu dog. The dog's calm, indifferent expression is used as a visual anchor to represent or symbolize the sentiment expressed in the text. This is an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the dog) is projected as the entity that 'feels' or 'expresses' the textual sentiment, even though dogs cannot hold such human sentiments. This mapping is central to the meme's function, using the dog's innocent appearance to contrast with the hateful message, thereby attempting to trivialize or normalize the racism.",
